{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME SOMETHING BEAUTIFUL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken disoriented in a socially fractured industrial estate. As the fog lifts from your mind, your search for answers reveals hidden secrets and a story that will carry you far beyond the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.poster.avif?t=1768171052\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.webm?t=1768171052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.mp4?t=1768171052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Atmospheric world</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through detailed industrial estates, descend into the sewers beneath them, and discover what lurks beyond Coil City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.poster.avif?t=1768171052\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.webm?t=1768171052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.mp4?t=1768171052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 